<title>UK: CRICKET-RAIN DELAYS START OF SECOND TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RAIN DELAYS START OF SECOND TEST.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steady rain washed out play before lunch on the opening day of the second test between England and Australia at Lord's on Thursday.</p>
<p>The umpires will inspect the ground again after the lunch interval scheduled for one p.m. (1200GMT).</p>
<p>Further showers and possible thunderstorms were forecast for the remainder of Thursday.</p>
</text>
